      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Traffic/latency exclude readiness and liveness probes. **4xx are client outcomes, not automatically backend failures.** No requests means no latency observations. Analytics counters measure best-effort delivery; published is queue acceptance, not a ClickHouse ACK. Core health is independent of ClickHouse."
